description: Secrets, tests-before-commit, no exploit PoCs
alwaysApply: true
---

# Quality invariants

- Secrets via env only. Never commit `.env`, keys, or `chat-context/`
- Write tests; leave git green. No `--no-verify`
- Commit by intent; message explains **why**
- Do not write vulnerability exploits or PoCs
- Human docs: skill `write-docs` (tests/code beat DESIGN beat docs/)
